<title>USA: United Cities acquires Arrow Propane.</title>
<headline>United Cities acquires Arrow Propane.</headline>
<dateline>BRENTWOOD, Tenn. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Cities Gas Co said on Friday it has purchased the assets of Arrow Propane Inc in Woodbury, Tenn., for approximately $660,000.</p>
<p>The acquisition adds 681 customers and an anticipated total annual volume of approximately 450,000 gallons, the company said.</p>
